 "sha256": "9b3d436d71c71b7d",
 "body": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\" class=\"no-js\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"utf-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1, maximum-scale=1, user-scalable=no\">\n    <!-- 匿名页面令牌已移除（公开归档不保留） -->\n    <meta name=\"renderer\" content=\"webkit\">\n    <script>\n        window.__feInitLocalTime = new Date().getTime() / 1000;\n        window.__feConfigVersion = '74d532c6c7861bfe'; window.__feConfigRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/config'; window.__fePhoneHomeCall = 'https\\u003A\\/\\/moshimoshi\\u003Aagltb3noatpwohhuenb5ag1tc2jsnnl3\\u0040errtrack.luogu.com.cn\\/lotlp1';        window.__luoguTagVersion = 'zh\\u002DCN\\/2026112514'; window.__luoguTagRequest = '\\/_lfe\\/tags';\n    </script>\n    <title>题解 P1028 【数的计算】 - 洛谷专栏</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/favicon.ico\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Security-Policy\" content=\"default-src 'unsafe-eval' 'unsafe-inline' luogu.com *.luogu.com luogu.com.cn *.luogu.com.cn luogu.org *.luogu.org wss: blob: luoguprivate.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com luogu.oss-cn-hangzhou.aliyuncs.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com https://*.dun.163yun.com https://*.dun.163.com https://*.nosdn.126.net https://*.nosdn.127.net https://nos.netease.com https://cstaticdun.126.net https://cstaticdun1.126.net https://cstaticdun-v6.126.net https://acstatic-dun.126.net; img-src * data:; font-src * data:; worker-src data: blob:; frame-src https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn https://player.bilibili.com https://www.bilibili.com https://challenges.cloudflare.com\">\n        <script id=\"lentille-context\" type=\"application/json\">{\"instance\":\"main\",\"template\":\"article.show\",\"status\":200,\"locale\":\"zh-CN\",\"data\":{\"article\":{\"lid\":\"a1sc0wom\",\"title\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3 P1028 \\u3010\\u6570\\u7684\\u8ba1\\u7b97\\u3011\",\"category\":2,\"time\":1471160157,\"author\":{\"uid\":21903,\"avatar\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/upload\\/usericon\\/21903.png\",\"name\":\"vegetabird\",\"slogan\":\"\",\"badge\":null,\"isAdmin\":false,\"isBanned\":false,\"color\":\"Blue\",\"ccfLevel\":0,\"xcpcLevel\":0,\"background\":\"\"},\"upvote\":568,\"replyCount\":148,\"favorCount\":1,\"status\":2,\"solutionFor\":{\"pid\":\"P1028\",\"type\":\"P\",\"name\":\"[NOIP 2001 \\u666e\\u53ca\\u7ec4] \\u6570\\u7684\\u8ba1\\u7b97\",\"difficulty\":2,\"fullScore\":100},\"promoteStatus\":0,\"collection\":null,\"content\":\"\\u597d\\u5427\\uff0c\\u8fd9\\u9053\\u9898\\u6709\\u4e24\\u79cd\\u89e3\\u6cd5\\n\\n\\u7b2c\\u4e00\\u79cd\\u4f30\\u8ba1\\u662f\\u5927\\u5bb6\\u4e00\\u4e0b\\u5b50\\u5c31\\u60f3\\u5230\\u7684\\uff1a\\n\\n\\u66b4\\u529b\\u9012\\u5f52\\uff01\\uff01\\uff08\\u5f88\\u660e\\u663e\\u4e0d\\u662f\\u6b63\\u89e3\\uff09\\n\\n\\u7c98\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u6211\\u7684\\u4ee3\\u7801\\n\\n```cpp\\n#include\\u003Ccstdio\\u003E\\nusing namespace std;\\nint n,cnt=1;\\nvoid func(int x){\\n    for(int i=1;i\\u003C=x\\/2;i++){\\n        cnt++;\\n        func(i);\\n    }\\n}\\nint main(){\\n    scanf(\\u0022%d\\u0022,\\u0026n);\\n    func(n);\\n    printf(\\u0022%d\\\\n\\u0022,cnt);\\n}\\n```\\n\\u8fd9\\u4e2a\\u9012\\u5f52\\u5927\\u6982\\u80fd\\u9a97\\u8fc7n=500\\uff0c\\u7136\\u800c\\u9898\\u76ee\\u4e2d\\u662fn\\u003C=1000\\n\\u6240\\u4ee5\\u6b63\\u89e3\\u80af\\u5b9a\\u4e0d\\u662f\\u66b4\\u529b\\n\\n\\u6b63\\u89e3\\u5176\\u5b9e\\u662f\\u9012\\u63a8\\uff08\\u4e5f\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u8bf4\\u662f\\u7b80\\u5355DP\\uff09\\n\\n\\u5148\\u7c98\\u4e2a\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u518d\\u89e3\\u91ca\\n\\n```cpp\\n#include\\u003Ccstdio\\u003E\\nusing namespace std;\\nint main(){\\n    int n,cnt=1,i,f[1010];\\n    f[0]=f[1]=1;\\n    scanf(\\u0022%d\\u0022,\\u0026n);\\n    for(i=2;i\\u003C=n;i++){\\n        if(i%2==0){\\n            f[i]=f[i-1]+f[i\\/2];\\n        }else{\\n            f[i]=f[i-1];\\n        }\\n    }\\n    printf(\\u0022%d\\\\n\\u0022,f[n]);\\n}\\n```\\n\\u5728\\u6253\\u4ee3\\u7801\\u4e4b\\u524d\\uff0c\\u6211\\u4eec\\u4e0d\\u59a8\\u624b\\u52a8\\u6a21\\u62df\\u4e00\\u4e0b\\n```cpp\\nn=0,n=1\\u65f6\\uff0c\\u7b54\\u6848\\u663e\\u7136\\u662f1\\nn=2, ans=2;    n=3,ans=2\\nn=4,ans=4;    n=5,ans=4\\nn=6,ans=6;    n=7,ans=6\\n```\\n\\u76f8\\u4fe1\\u5927\\u5bb6\\u4e5f\\u53d1\\u73b0\\u4e86\\uff0c2n\\u4e0e2n+1(n\\u4e3a\\u975e\\u8d1f\\u6574\\u6570)\\u7684\\u7b54\\u6848\\u662f\\u4e00\\u6837\\u7684\\n\\u8fd9\\u5c31\\u662f\\u7b2c\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u89c4\\u5f8b\\n\\n\\u7136\\u540e\\u6211\\u4eec\\u4ee5n=8\\u4e3a\\u4f8b\\uff0c\\u624b\\u52a8\\u6a21\\u62df\\u4e00\\u4e0b\\n\\n\\u4e00\\u5171\\u670910\\u7ec4\\u89e3\\n\\n8\\n1 8            2 8            3 8            4 8\\n\\n1 2 8            1 3 8        1 4 8        2 4 8\\n\\n1 2 4 8\\n\\n\\u6211\\u6253\\u51fa\\u7684\\u4e1c\\u897f\\u5f88\\u50cf\\u4e00\\u68f5\\u641c\\u7d22\\u6811\\u3002\\u3002\\u3002\\n\\n\\u5f53\\u6211\\u4eec\\u628a8\\u548c8\\u4e0b\\u9762\\u7684\\u5de6\\u4e09\\u68f5\\u5b50\\u6811\\u653e\\u5728\\u4e00\\u8d77\\uff08\\u53738\\u548c\\u4e0b\\u9762\\u4e09\\u5217\\uff09\\uff0c\\u5e76\\u5c06\\u6240\\u6709\\u76848\\u90fd\\u6539\\u62107\\uff0c\\u6211\\u4eec\\u80fd\\u53d1\\u73b0\\uff0c\\u6211\\u4eec\\u5f97\\u5230\\u4e86n=7\\u65f6\\u7684\\u6240\\u6709\\u89e3\\uff1b\\n\\n\\u6211\\u4eec\\u518d\\u628a\\u6700\\u53f3\\u7aef\\u7684\\u5b50\\u6811\\uff08\\u5373\\u5269\\u4e0b\\u7684\\u90e8\\u5206\\uff09\\u4e2d\\u7684\\u6240\\u67098\\u5220\\u53bb\\uff0c\\u6211\\u4eec\\u5f97\\u5230\\u4e86n=4\\u65f6\\u7684\\u6240\\u6709\\u89e3\\n\\n\\u5c31\\u8fd9\\u6837\\uff0c\\u6211\\u4eec\\u53ef\\u4ee5\\u5f97\\u5230\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u9012\\u63a8\\u5f0f\\uff0c\\n\\n        f(n)=f(n-1)                \\/\\/7=8-1\\n\\n            +f(n\\/2)                \\/\\/4=8\\/2\\n\\n\\u518d\\u7ed3\\u5408\\u4e4b\\u524d\\u53d1\\u73b0\\u7684\\u89c4\\u5f8b\\n\\n\\u5c31\\u80fd\\u5f97\\u5230\\uff1a\\n\\n```cpp\\nn%2==0\\u65f6\\n    f(n)=f(n-1)+f(n\\/2)\\nn%2==1\\u65f6\\n    f(n)=f(n-1)\\n\\u7136\\u540e\\u95ee\\u9898\\u5c31\\u8fce\\u5203\\u800c\\u89e3\\u5566\\n```\",\"categoryOld\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"contentFull\":true,\"adminNote\":null},\"favored\":false,\"voted\":null,\"canReply\":false,\"canEdit\":false},\"user\":null,\"time\":1795593094.799094}</script>            <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n    <link rel=\"stylesheet\" href=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/loader.20261113-2335.css\" />\n    <script src=\"https://fecdn.luogu.com.cn/columba/vendor.20261113-2335.js\" charset=\"utf-8\" defer></script>\n        <link rel=\"canonical\" href=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/a1sc0wom\" />\n    <script type=\"application/ld+json\">{\"@context\":\"https:\\/\\/schema.org\",\"@type\":\"Article\",\"name\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3 P1028 \\u3010\\u6570\\u7684\\u8ba1\\u7b97\\u3011\",\"description\":\"\\u597d\\u5427\\uff0c\\u8fd9\\u9053\\u9898\\u6709\\u4e24\\u79cd\\u89e3\\u6cd5\\n\\u7b2c\\u4e00\\u79cd\\u4f30\\u8ba1\\u662f\\u5927\\u5bb6\\u4e00\\u4e0b\\u5b50\\u5c31\\u60f3\\u5230\\u7684\\uff1a\\n\\u66b4\\u529b\\u9012\\u5f52\\uff01\\uff01\\uff08\\u5f88\\u660e\\u663e\\u4e0d\\u662f\\u6b63\\u89e3\\uff09\\n\\u7c98\\u4e00\\u4e2a\\u6211\\u7684\\u4ee3\\u7801\\n#include&lt;cstdio&gt;\\nusing namespace std;\\nint n,cnt=1;\\nvoid func(int\\u2026\",\"genre\":\"\\u9898\\u89e3\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Person\",\"name\":\"vegetabird\"},\"datePublished\":\"2016-08-14T15:35:57+08:00\"}</script>\n    <meta property=\"og:type\" content=\"article\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:title\" content=\"题解 P1028 【数的计算】\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:description\" content=\"好吧，这道题有两种解法\n第一种估计是大家一下子就想到的：\n暴力递归！！（很明显不是正解）\n粘一个我的代码\n#include&amp;lt;cstdio&amp;gt;\nusing namespace std;\nint n,cnt=1;\nvoid func(int…\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:section\" content=\"题解\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:author\" content=\"vegetabird\" />\n    <meta property=\"article:published_time\" content=\"2016-08-14T15:35:57+08:00\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:url\" content=\"https://www.luogu.com/article/a1sc0wom\" />\n    <meta property=\"og:site_name\" content=\"洛谷专栏\" />\n        <script id=\"luogu-theme\" type=\"application/json\">{\"id\":1,\"lNavi\":{\"back\":\"#ffffff\",\"fore\":\"#262626\",\"logo\":null},\"lBody\":{\"back\":\"#f0f4fa\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-l.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}},\"dNavi\":{\"back\":\"#1d2025\",\"fore\":\"#ffffff\",\"logo\":\"#ffffff\"},\"dBody\":{\"back\":\"#0d1018\",\"blur\":1000,\"fade\":1000,\"image\":\"https:\\/\\/cdn.luogu.com.cn\\/images\\/bg\\/fe\\/luogu4-bg-d.jpg\",\"midOpts\":{\"size\":\"cover\"}}}</script>\n    <style></style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div id=\"app\">\n    <noscript>\n        <h3>请<b style=\"color:#f00;\">不要禁用</b>脚本，否则网页无法正常加载</h3>\n    </noscript>\n        <article>\n        <h1>题解 P1028 【数的计算】</h1>\n        <p style=\"font-size: .75em;\">\n            <a rel=\"author\">vegetabird</a>\n            ·\n            <time datetime=\"2016-08-14T15:35:57+08:00\">2016-08-14 15:35:57</time>\n            ·\n            <a href=\"/article?category=2\">题解</a>\n        </p>\n\n        <p>好吧，这道题有两种解法</p>\n<p>第一种估计是大家一下子就想到的：</p>\n<p>暴力递归！！（很明显不是正解）</p>\n<p>粘一个我的代码</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include&lt;cstdio&gt;\nusing namespace std;\nint n,cnt=1;\nvoid func(int x){\n    for(int i=1;i&lt;=x/2;i++){\n        cnt++;\n        func(i);\n    }\n}\nint main(){\n    scanf(\"%d\",&amp;n);\n    func(n);\n    printf(\"%d\\n\",cnt);\n}</code></pre>\n<p>这个递归大概能骗过n=500，然而题目中是n&lt;=1000\n所以正解肯定不是暴力</p>\n<p>正解其实是递推（也可以说是简单DP）</p>\n<p>先粘个代码再解释</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">#include&lt;cstdio&gt;\nusing namespace std;\nint main(){\n    int n,cnt=1,i,f[1010];\n    f[0]=f[1]=1;\n    scanf(\"%d\",&amp;n);\n    for(i=2;i&lt;=n;i++){\n        if(i%2==0){\n            f[i]=f[i-1]+f[i/2];\n        }else{\n            f[i]=f[i-1];\n        }\n    }\n    printf(\"%d\\n\",f[n]);\n}</code></pre>\n<p>在打代码之前，我们不妨手动模拟一下</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">n=0,n=1时，答案显然是1\nn=2, ans=2;    n=3,ans=2\nn=4,ans=4;    n=5,ans=4\nn=6,ans=6;    n=7,ans=6</code></pre>\n<p>相信大家也发现了，2n与2n+1(n为非负整数)的答案是一样的\n这就是第一个规律</p>\n<p>然后我们以n=8为例，手动模拟一下</p>\n<p>一共有10组解</p>\n<p>8\n1 8            2 8            3 8            4 8</p>\n<p>1 2 8            1 3 8        1 4 8        2 4 8</p>\n<p>1 2 4 8</p>\n<p>我打出的东西很像一棵搜索树。。。</p>\n<p>当我们把8和8下面的左三棵子树放在一起（即8和下面三列），并将所有的8都改成7，我们能发现，我们得到了n=7时的所有解；</p>\n<p>我们再把最右端的子树（即剩下的部分）中的所有8删去，我们得到了n=4时的所有解</p>\n<p>就这样，我们可以得到一个递推式，</p>\n<pre><code>    f(n)=f(n-1)                //7=8-1\n\n        +f(n/2)                //4=8/2</code></pre>\n<p>再结合之前发现的规律</p>\n<p>就能得到：</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-cpp\">n%2==0时\n    f(n)=f(n-1)+f(n/2)\nn%2==1时\n    f(n)=f(n-1)\n然后问题就迎刃而解啦</code></pre>\n    </article>\n</div>\n<script>(function(){function c(){var b=a.contentDocument||(a.contentWindow&&a.contentWindow.document);if(b){var d=b.createElement('script');d.innerHTML=\"window.__CF$cv$params={r:'a5ff11a99c42f29d',t:'MTc5NTU5MzA5NA=='};var l=window.parent.location,o;try{o=new URL(l.origin).origin}catch(e){try{o=new URL(new URL(l.href).origin).origin}catch(e){o=''}}var u='/cdn-cgi/challenge-platform/scripts/jsd/main.js?ray=a5ff11a99c42f29d',a=document.createElement('script');a.src=o?new URL(u,o).href:u;document.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(a);\";b.getElementsByTagName('head')[0].appendChild(d)}}if(document.body){var a=document.createElement('iframe');a.height=1;a.width=1;a.style.position='absolute';a.style.top=0;a.style.left=0;a.style.border='none';a.style.visibility='hidden';document.body.appendChild(a);if('loading'!==document.readyState)c();else if(window.addEventListener)document.addEventListener('DOMContentLoaded',c);else{var e=document.onreadystatechange||function(){};document.onreadystatechange=function(b){e(b);'loading'!==document.readyState&&(document.onreadystatechange=e,c())}}}})();</script></body>\n</html>\n",
